# Monitor RabbitMQ integration verification

When changes under these globs can alter monitor -> RabbitMQ behavior, do not stop at unit tests alone.

- Run `make -C HPCPerfStats/monitor/.build-static check-rabbitmq-integration` after the canonical static build path is ready.
- If `.build-static` is not configured yet, run `HPCPerfStats/monitor/scripts/build_static_bundle.sh` first, then run the integration target.
- Treat this as additive to `monitor-dual-verify-cross-and-static`: this rule adds RabbitMQ message contract verification, it does not replace static bundle + cross-compile verification.
- Consider edits substantive when they can affect connection/login settings, queue declare/bind behavior, payload body formatting, AMQP publish properties, or send/retry orchestration.
- Report integration-test pass/fail status explicitly in the handoff.
